{
  "schema_version": "0.1",
  "id": "streamsim/belt-conveyor",
  "version": 1,
  "title": "Belt conveyor with shared drives",
  "description": "A 60 m belt at 2 m/s pulled by several drives that share its force equally. It carries the material fed onto it, needs a larger force to break loose from rest than to keep running, stalls when its drives cannot pull it, and stops when the next machine withdraws its run permit. A loaded belt that its available drives cannot restart is stranded.",
